# Beyond Infinity (jeuno 137, limit break 10): the Nomad Moogle in Ru'Lude Gardens (no script; default event 10045 (0, 0,
# 2, 0)), Maat (the first of that name), Horlais Peak's BC_Entrance. A level 91 Warrior at level cap 95, Prelude to
# Puissance completed, the Limit Breaker and the Soul Gem Clasp (Prelude to Puissance's reward) held (GM, before login),
# MAX_LEVEL 99. Available: five High Kindred's Crests (no trade handler: nothing); 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 0); option 0:
# nothing; the local var rejectedStartLB10 1 (a GM; Prelude to Puissance's option 15 sets it): 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 1);
# option 15: nothing (not a begin option); option 13: begun (no set-down; the clasp held, so state 2's finish runs in the
# same lookup: 13 is none of its options). Accepted, Prog 0, the clasp: the moogle's event 10045 (91, 1, 5, 1) (option
# 0: nothing); the crests (state 4 needs no clasp: no trade handler: nil); Maat's 10193; the moogle again, option 16: set
# down at Horlais Peak. There, BC_Entrance's 32000 menu (accepted, the clasp), Beyond Infinity (index 20) in area 1
# (the clasp worn on entry), Atori-Tutori killed (won, battlefieldWin 20), 32001: a Scroll of Instant Warp, Prog 1.
# Back at the moogle: 10139 (75, 1); completed: Bushin Aspirant, level cap 99, YOUR_LEVEL_LIMIT_IS_NOW_99. Completed at
# level 91: event 10045 (91, 1, 0, 0).
# Other quests on the moogle (the limit breaks 6-9 and Martial Mastery) and on Maat (limit breaks 1-5, Beyond the Sun,
# Trust: Maat): none answers a level 91 char at cap 95 / 99 with Prelude to Puissance completed and no combat skill.
# #no_key, #level90, #max_level, #cap and #prelude take the available section's operands; #waughroon, #balgas and #qubia
# the other set-downs and arenas; #lost the failed-battlefield state 4; #win_other the 32001's other sides; #compete the reply kinds;
# #completed99 the completed state at level 99 / 98; #state2 state 2's clasp and Prog operands; #status the status operand of state 2 and of state 4's trade; #mid_event the finishes
# outside their states.
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrade RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10139 HorlaisPeak/BC_Entrance/onTrigger HorlaisPeak/onEventFinish/32001
warning: quests: jeuno.beyond_infinity: one finish of 10045 ran 2 handlers (1/-/onEventFinish:10045, 2/-/onEventFinish:10045) -- the Lua runs it twice too: its sections at LB10_Beyond_Infinity.lua:77 (available), :135 (accepted) and :207 (accepted, Prog 0, no Soul Gem Clasp) at lua-at d8964eb5 hold the finish, and the lookup reads each check after the earlier handlers ran, so the first's status change lets the second match
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=11.5,2.5,121.9 job=WAR lvl=91
levelcap 95
quest Jeuno.PreludeToPuissance completed
keyitem LimitBreaker
keyitem SoulGemClasp
item HighKindredsCrest x5
login
trade Nomad_Moogle HighKindredsCrest x5 # available: no trade handler (state 4 is accepted): nothing
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # available: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 0)
finish option=0                         # not a begin option: nothing
localvar rejectedStartLB10 1            # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 1)
finish option=15                        # not a begin option: nothing
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 1)
finish option=13                        # begun; no set-down; state 2's finish (the clasp held): 13 no arm
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # accepted, Prog 0, the clasp: event 10045 (91, 1, 5, 1)
finish option=0                         # none of 16 / 22 / 23 / 24: nothing
trade Nomad_Moogle HighKindredsCrest x5 # the clasp held: no state 4: no trade handler: nil, nothing
trigger Maat                            # state 2: event 10193
finish
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # event 10045 (91, 1, 5, 1)
finish option=16                        # set down at Horlais Peak (-511.459 159.004 -210.543)
tick 400                                # the zone change runs at the tick
login                                   # in Horlais Peak
warp -501.5,158.3,-212.6 HorlaisPeak    # by BC_Entrance (a GM warp: the flow parser follows zones by warp)
trigger BC_Entrance                    # accepted, the clasp: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=321                 # Beyond Infinity (Horlais Peak), index 20, area 1: registered, entered; the clasp worn (SOUL_GEM_REACTS, LOST_KEYITEM)
finish                                  # in the arena
kill ATORI_TUTORI                       # area 1's Atori-Tutori: won, battlefieldWin 20, 32001 opens
finish                                  # 32001, battlefieldWin 20 (this arena's): a Scroll of Instant Warp, Prog 1
warp 11.5,2.5,121.9 RuludeGardens
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # accepted, Prog 1: 10139 (75, 1)
finish                                  # completed: Bushin Aspirant, level cap 99, YOUR_LEVEL_LIMIT_IS_NOW_99
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # completed, level 91: event 10045 (91, 1, 0, 0)
finish
